   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "41791b6d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 02 — Pemodelan LSTM Unidirectional pada Data Baru (v2)\n",
    "Notebook ini melatih model LSTM unidirectional pada representasi teks `processed_text_v2`:\n",
    "- **Arsitektur**: Keras Embedding (10.000, 128) $\r",
    "ightarrow$ LSTM (64 units) $\r",
    "ightarrow$ Dropout (0.2) $\r",
    "ightarrow$ Dense (3, Softmax)\n",
    "- **Varian**: Natural Baseline dan Cost-Sensitive Class Weight\n",
    "- **Evaluasi**: Test Set ($n=1.730$) dengan confusion matrix dan classification report.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "32dfe110",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-09-02T11:19:11.326485Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-09-02T11:19:11.325464Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-09-02T11:19:25.873361Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-09-02T11:19:25.873361Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "import tensorflow as tf\n",
    "from tensorflow.keras.preprocessing.text import Tokenizer\n",
    "from tensorflow.keras.preprocessing.sequence import pad_sequences\n",
    "from tensorflow.keras.models import Sequential\n",
    "from tensorflow.keras.layers import Embedding, LSTM, Dropout, Dense\n",
    "from tensorflow.keras.callbacks import EarlyStopping\n",
    "from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n",
    "from sklearn.utils.class_weight import compute_class_weight\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics import classification_report, confusion_matrix, accuracy_score, f1_score\n",
    "\n",
    "# Lock seed\n",
    "tf.random.set_seed(42)\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "\n",
    "if Path.cwd().name == \"notebooks\":\n",
    "    os.chdir(\"..\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b669d38d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Load Data v2 dan Tokenisasi\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "6a0573b9",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-09-02T11:19:25.878662Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-09-02T11:19:25.877292Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-09-02T11:19:26.536291Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-09-02T11:19:26.536291Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df = pd.read_csv(\"Data/processed/banjir_processed_v2.csv\")\n",
    "tr_val, test_df = train_test_split(df, test_size=0.20, stratify=df['label'], random_state=42)\n",
    "train_df, val_df = train_test_split(tr_val, test_size=0.10, stratify=tr_val['label'], random_state=42)\n",
    "\n",
    "tokenizer = Tokenizer(num_words=10000, oov_token=\"<OOV>\")\n",
    "tokenizer.fit_on_texts(train_df['processed_text_v2'])\n",
    "\n",
    "X_tr = pad_sequences(tokenizer.texts_to_sequences(train_df['processed_text_v2']), maxlen=50, padding='post', truncating='post')\n",
    "X_va = pad_sequences(tokenizer.texts_to_sequences(val_df['processed_text_v2']), maxlen=50, padding='post', truncating='post')\n",
    "X_te = pad_sequences(tokenizer.texts_to_sequences(test_df['processed_text_v2']), maxlen=50, padding='post', truncating='post')\n",
    "\n",
    "y_tr = train_df['label'].values\n",
    "y_va = val_df['label'].values\n",
    "y_te = test_df['label'].values\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1ce6c925",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
